","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其一","author":"薛瑄","text":"行台西接大明湖，细柳新荷入画图。\n海石风光今古意，品题殊觉少陵孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5324,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其二","author":"薛瑄","text":"独宿行台暑气清，清吟已觉动高情。\n令人苦忆黄诗伯，肯许连床听雨声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5325,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其三","author":"薛瑄","text":"杨柳阴阴宪府深，读书因见圣贤心。\n钟期去后今千载，谁复人间是赏音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5326,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其四","author":"薛瑄","text":"猎猎风蒲水满塘，轻阴微雨芰荷香。\n偶来乘兴观时物，徐步芳洲趁晚凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5327,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其五","author":"薛瑄","text":"烟笼庭树水侵阶，隐隐轻云细雨来。\n爽气已添烦暑退，好怀千古一时开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5328,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其六","author":"薛瑄","text":"绿柳红葵满宪台，清渠碧沼断尘埃。\n城头雨过天无际，高鸟孤云自往来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5329,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其七","author":"薛瑄","text":"菰蒲深处水禽鸣，雨过林塘晚更清。\n露满碧荷看不定，秪疑仙掌万珠明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5330,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其八","author":"薛瑄","text":"柏台清昼鸟声閒，影落高梧夏日寒。\n且喜轻阴天际敛，开门咫尺见南山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5331,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其九","author":"薛瑄","text":"水满方塘盖锦萍，软风高下飏蜻蜓。\n清宵雨歇蛙声急，却忆湖湘草色青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5332,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其十","author":"薛瑄","text":"万朵红葵折锦苞，新妆相倚斗妖娆。\n道人独爱倾阳意，并起丹心忆圣朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5333,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其十一","author":"薛瑄","text":"行台直北是高城，城外溪流面面清。\n更拟濠梁寻胜事，观鱼侈有昔人情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5334,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其十二","author":"薛瑄","text":"明时叨秩意何如，秪向行台读古书。\n自得自歌还自乐，青天白水看鸢鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5335,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其十三","author":"薛瑄","text":"四月行台暑雨过，方池无数长新荷。\n贪观物意归来晚，杨柳薰风到面多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5336,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其十四","author":"薛瑄","text":"潇洒流年老铁冠，鬓毛虽白寸心丹。\n天书重叠叨天宠，骢马长鸣宇宙宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5337,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其十五","author":"薛瑄","text":"耿耿江湖意不忘，频年草疏奏明光。\n行台夏日看时物，最爱葵花向太阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5338,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其十六","author":"薛瑄","text":"忆捧天书别九天，分符频与岁时迁。\n行台几度逢佳节，五月薰风入舜弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5339,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其十七","author":"薛瑄","text":"夏雷挟雨急倾盆，风色苍苍晚更昏。\n清晓行台看双沼，新荷已没旧波痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5340,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其十八","author":"薛瑄","text":"泰山触石云初起，六合茫茫一雨同。\n试听康衢应有颂，调和玉烛圣明功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5341,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其十九","author":"薛瑄","text":"绕屋葵花锦作围，画墙墙外柳依依。\n日长庭院游丝静，乳燕穿帘自在飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5342,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台杂咏简黄宪长暨诸宪僚二十首 其二十","author":"薛瑄","text":"万顷平湖接宪台，红莲如锦望中开。\n何当与客凌飞阁，更揽山川入壮怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5343,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赵雍画马三首 其一","author":"薛瑄","text":"逸气棱棱不受羁，苍林磨痒立多时。\n会应有待王良驭，掣电追风始见奇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5344,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赵雍画马三首 其二","author":"薛瑄","text":"白面骊驹汗血乾，风鬃倚树玉蹄攒。\n谁人为制青丝络，骑出横门万众看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5345,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赵雍画马三首 其三","author":"薛瑄","text":"玉马王孙已入周，曾将绝艺写骅骝。\n谩誇有子能传业，不道东陵有故侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5346,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读峄山碑","author":"薛瑄","text":"六国平来四海家，相君当代擅才华。\n谁知颂德山头石，却与他人戒后车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5347,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重题临胊行台四柏二首 其一","author":"薛瑄","text":"四柏移栽已二年，重来相对意留连。\n时人莫比甘棠树，浅薄惭无惠化传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5348,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重题临胊行台四柏二首 其二","author":"薛瑄","text":"宪府重来柏渐高，良材元不困蓬蒿。\n还应老大惊人目，香叶团空有凤巢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5349,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重题胶州行台二首 其一","author":"薛瑄","text":"六年三按古胶东，两见葵花五月红。\n却忆端阳沾赐扇，曾陪鹓侣觐飞龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5350,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重题胶州行台二首 其二","author":"薛瑄","text":"留题今是两端阳，海气仍飘五月凉。\n却爱名花当户发，还将远意采幽香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5351,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四景为李通政赋四首 其一","author":"薛瑄","text":"石桥流水自东西，绿树连云翠嶂低。\n却忆当年持宪节，扁舟曾泛武陵溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5352,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四景为李通政赋四首 其二","author":"薛瑄","text":"红尘飞不到青山，宛转桥东水閤寒。\n立尽夕阳桥上客，看山看水不知还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5353,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四景为李通政赋四首 其三","author":"薛瑄","text":"木落霜青水不波，野人茅屋带岩阿。\n幽林采得怜香洁，坐对南山兴最多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5354,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四景为李通政赋四首 其四","author":"薛瑄","text":"竹林茅屋枕江皋，叠玉峰峦夹岸高。\n似是剡溪清兴发，独冲风雪泛轻舠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5355,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四景为张给事题四首 其一","author":"薛瑄","text":"云满青山水满溪，百花如锦草萋萋。\n少陵诗思知多少，到处娇莺恰恰啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5356,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四景为张给事题四首 其二","author":"薛瑄","text":"百尺清潭万仞山，山围水閤下虚寒。\n道人已自无焦火，况在山光水色间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5357,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四景为张给事题四首 其三","author":"薛瑄","text":"无边草木不禁霜，只有黄花晚更香。\n笑采黄花斟美酒，南山咫尺兴难忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5358,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四景为张给事题四首 其四","author":"薛瑄","text":"仙家楼观郁嵯峨，雪岭冰溪眼底过。\n驴背探春春信早，诗情不必灞桥多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5359,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋宿杂咏十首 其一","author":"薛瑄","text":"高堂灯火夜相亲，点检诗书忆古人。\n自愧久持三尺法，一生长保寸心春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5360,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋宿杂咏十首 其二","author":"薛瑄","text":"霜竹风寒夜向深，灯前读易见天心。\n京华又是逢长至，坐忆尧夫子半吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5361,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋宿杂咏十首 其三","author":"薛瑄","text":"再入霜台持宪节，又承丹诏育菁莪。\n只今理寺通朝籍，倍觉天恩滚滚多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5362,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋宿杂咏十首 其四","author":"薛瑄","text":"灯花静夜结金虫，炉火其如树杪风。\n小阁有春应自省，此心期与万人同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5363,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋宿杂咏十首 其五","author":"薛瑄","text":"法从追陪二十年，寸心期不愧先贤。\n士师自是庭坚职，尚忆虞廷咏敕天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5364,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋宿杂咏十首 其六","author":"薛瑄","text":"马蹄频踏暮街尘，理寺归来月色新。\n静室有心空自省，忘言相对是何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5365,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋宿杂咏十首 其七","author":"薛瑄","text":"金门待漏三更月，玉陛趋朝五色云。\n补衮即非樗散质，微诚长祝圣明君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5366,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋宿杂咏十首 其八","author":"薛瑄","text":"迹忝鹓行第几班，朝回马上看西山。\n雪崖冰谷清如许，咫尺烟霞未可攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5367,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋宿杂咏十首 其九","author":"薛瑄","text":"待伴未消窗外雪，宜人偏爱竹间风。\n斋居已自心如洗，况与寒宵此景同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5368,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋宿杂咏十首 其十","author":"薛瑄","text":"都城钟鼓夜深沈，棘寺灯前有客吟。\n不是少陵耽丽句，虚台元是发清音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5369,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈希夷图","author":"薛瑄","text":"白云回首是三峰，宴坐苍苔睡正浓。\n人世红尘浑断绝，野花啼鸟自春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5370,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题枯木竹石四首 其一 野渚春容","author":"薛瑄","text":"荒溪野渚曲流通，苍翠巑岏淑气中。\n潇洒一般春意思，纷纷红紫挹高风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5371,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题枯木竹石四首 其二 临波春意","author":"薛瑄","text":"苍玉生苔浸绿波，新篁老木散枝柯。\n徒劳人世歌招隐，淡荡东风野兴多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5372,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题枯木竹石四首 其三 淡霭凉生","author":"薛瑄","text":"扁舟几度泛湘波，老木疏篁翠石多。\n凉吹淡烟图画里，远怀清绝奈秋何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5373,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题枯木竹石四首 其四 萧骚霁雪","author":"薛瑄","text":"山间昨夜雪三尺，晓云如拭天无痕。\n怪得清声满人世，石林冻竹风翻翻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5374,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其一","author":"薛瑄","text":"一室无尘静有馀，清风频度小窗虚。\n韦编读罢心如水，閒看浮云自捲舒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5375,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其二","author":"薛瑄","text":"扰扰征途二十年，萧萧短发赋归田。\n青山绿水都如旧，得失升沉事落然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5376,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其三","author":"薛瑄","text":"早知大道心无外，始觉身閒乐有馀。\n一卷陶诗千载兴，悔将名利役慵疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5377,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句四首 其一","author":"薛瑄","text":"疏懒经旬不出门，炎风暑气任昏昏。\n饥餐渴饮披书卷，高卧开窗看白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5378,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句四首 其二","author":"薛瑄","text":"忆昔曾游海上山，夏云冬雪满征鞍。\n如今嬴得身无事，一榻清风白昼閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5379,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句四首 其三","author":"薛瑄","text":"长江风起浪如山，驿路红尘几往还。\n三十年前回首处，烟蓑依旧钓矶閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5380,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句四首 其四","author":"薛瑄","text":"年少争名老可羞，青山绿水去来休。\n是非得失何须问，已是忘机伴白鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5381,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汾上春日二首 其一","author":"薛瑄","text":"道边桃李绿阴繁，花落难招万片魂。\n只有清汾流不尽，年年长是绕孤村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5382,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汾上春日二首 其二","author":"薛瑄","text":"汾水春流岸岸深，水村新绿满春林。\n残红已逐东风尽，不道游人负赏心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5383,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿青桥驿听江声","author":"薛瑄","text":"青桥驿近黑龙江，江上滩声暗入窗。\n高枕才眠过夜半，惊回旅梦正淙淙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5384,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草凉楼驿","author":"薛瑄","text":"翠华西幸驻山间，草阁乘凉动喜颜。\n何似长安歌舞地，凤楼千尺更高寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5385,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝天驿","author":"薛瑄","text":"征骖行尽褒南道，又上朝天驿畔舟。\n两岸云林青未了，嘉陵南去水悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5386,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盆池鱼","author":"薛瑄","text":"浮游南北与西束，不出区区斗水中。\n何似巨鳞居大海，波涵天地浪摇风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5387,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛川江有感","author":"薛瑄","text":"双亲未老我童年，曾泛岷江六月船。\n今日重来泛江水，我衰亲没泪潸然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5388,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏夜宿龙瓜驿","author":"薛瑄","text":"风树飕飗雨不休，夜眠江馆似深秋。\n梦回忽见窗前烛，驿吏催人又放舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5389,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"效竹枝歌三首 其一","author":"薛瑄","text":"锦官城东多水楼，蜀姬酒浓消客愁。\n醉来忘却家山道，劝君莫作锦城游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5390,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"效竹枝歌三首 其二","author":"薛瑄","text":"江上小楼开户多，蜀侬解唱巴渝歌。\n清江中夜月如昼，楼头贾客奈乐何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5391,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"效竹枝歌三首 其三","author":"薛瑄","text":"杨柳昽昽天欲明，锦江夜雨江水生。\n盐船无数恶年少，閒上江楼看晓晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5392,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"却赠","author":"薛瑄","text":"有人情重赠尤多，奈我中心义理何。\n纵使尽添齐楚富，一身之外总为他。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5393,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"放船","author":"薛瑄","text":"野旷天低江面平，放船东下好风清。\n江天况值新晴霁，云白山青望眼明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":5394,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]